        <div class="about-content">
            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <p>LatestNews is a small publishing desk. Writers sign in, file a story under a topic, and an editor publishes it to the home page.</p>
            <p>The articles, accounts, and topics on this site are stored in a SQLite database. The pages you are reading are rendered by the server from those records.</p>
            <p>This version is meant to run on your own computer. Change the demo admin password before you put it anywhere public.</p>
        </div>
